    "| `<studentNumber>.xlsx` | Dashboard workbook — KPI tiles, native (editable) Excel charts, and the supporting data tabs. The Excel mirror of the PDF student report. |\n",
    "| `<studentNumber>_forms.xlsx` | Flat **one row per form** export — the file students ask for so they can compare their own comments, supervisor comments, entrustment, commendations and areas for improvement across every form, with the supervisor who marked each one. |\n",
    "\n",
    "**Choosing sheets.** Every sheet is its own `_sheet*` function, registered in `STUDENT_SHEETS`. Pass `sheets=[...]` to any builder — list order is tab order — or edit the defaults in `DASHBOARD_SHEETS` / `FORM_EXPORT_SHEETS`. Run `listStudentSheets()` for the catalogue. Only the data a chosen sheet needs is queried, so a short list is genuinely cheaper. Unknown sheet names raise immediately rather than silently producing a thinner file.\n",
