    "Only curated, human-readable columns are written: no raw JSON (`patient_data` / `student_data` / `assessor_data`), no `*_config`, no schema snapshots, no internal IDs and no e-mail addresses. `_assertNoRawColumns` re-checks every workbook before it is saved.\n",
